ot the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:background_normalization_minor", "why": "This is a collection of minor background uncertainties, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:syst:background_fit", "why": "This is a different type of uncertainty related to the ABCD method, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:w_plus_jets_modelling", "why": "This is specific to W+jets background, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:z_plus_jets_modelling", "why": "This is specific to Z+jets background, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:data_driven_bkg_method_uncertainty", "why": "This is a general category of uncorrelated uncertainties, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbar_modelling", "why": "This is specific to ttbar background, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:minor_bkg_normalization", "why": "This is a general category of minor background uncertainties, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:cr_data_statistics", "why": "This is related to statistical uncertainty in control regions, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:single_top_modelling", "why": "This is specific to single-top-quark background, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:combinatorial-bkg-normalization-stat", "why": "Statistical uncertainty, not systematic uncertainty related to background normalization."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:cr-normalisation", "why": "General term for normalization, not specific to background normalization uncertainties."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:background-shape-fourier", "why": "Uncertainty related to the shape of the background, not specifically normalization."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon_bkg_desc_jpsi_cr", "why": "Parameterization of the background function, not specifically normalization uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:symmetric_background_estimate", "why": "Statistical uncertainty, not systematic uncertainty related to background normalization."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:reducible_background_estimation", "why": "Specific to Z+X background, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:vh-normalization", "why": "Specific to VH background, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:vvv-normalization", "why": "Specific to VVV triboson background, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:total-systematic-inclusive", "why": "Mentions combined inclusive $t\bar{t}Z$ cross section, but not specifically about background normalisation uncertainties."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:zjets_normalization", "why": "Specific to Z+jets background, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbar_relative_normalization", "why": "Specific to ttbar background, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:nonresonant_bkg_ggh_10pct", "why": "Specific to nonresonant background in ggH+2jets categorization, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:data-driven-ttbar", "why": "Specific to data-driven $t\bar{t}$ background, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:diboson_normalisation", "why": "Specific to diboson cross-section normalisation, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:pdf_scale_variation", "why": "Specific to PDF and scale uncertainties, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:minor-background-xsec", "why": "Mentions cross-section normalisation for minor backgrounds, but not specifically the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:inclusive_ttC_xsec", "why": "Specific to inclusive ttC cross section, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:background-total-uncertainty", "why": "General total background uncertainty, not specific to the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:charge_misid_normalization_unc", "why": "Specific to charge (sign) misidentification background, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:misid_ltau_lprime", "why": "Specific to misidentified background, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:wz-ewk-normalization", "why": "Specific background normalization uncertainty for a particular process, but not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:multijet-uncertainty", "why": "Uncertainty related to multi-jet background estimation, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:combinatorial-bkg-shape-pileup", "why": "Uncertainty related to combinatorial background shape from pileup, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:theory-scale-pdf-xsec", "why": "Theoretical uncertainties including cross-section normalisation, but not specifically the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:nonprompt-background-uncertainty", "why": "Uncertainty related to nonprompt lepton background normalization and shape, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbarx-tttt-diboson-normalization", "why": "Normalization uncertainty for specific backgrounds, but not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:fakes-vv-ttz-norm", "why": "Normalization-factor uncertainty for fakes and diboson backgrounds, free to vary in fit, but not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:background_rate_normalization", "why": "Normalization uncertainty for multiple backgrounds, but not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:mc-statistics", "why": "Statistical uncertainty in background predictions, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ew_ttbar_cross_section", "why": "Normalization uncertainty for electroweak and ttbar backgrounds, but not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:background-extrapolation-bias", "why": "Uncertainty related to background extrapolation bias, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:background-variance-kfold", "why": "Variance uncertainty in background, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:jets-and-met", "why": "Uncertainties related to jets and missing transverse momentum, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:jet_energy_scale_resolution", "why": "Uncertainties related to jet energy scale and resolution, not the combined inclusive fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:pdf-alphas", "why": "PDF set and alpha_s uncertainty for major backgrounds, not the combined inclusive fit."}]}], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "value=set_1_refined", "abstention_challenged": false, "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 142.46332662319764, "llm_calls": 4.0, "tokens": 25068.0, "rounds": 4.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 0.0, "claimed_count": 37.0, "count_error": 35.0, "tool_calls": 3.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 68.0, "evidence_quotes": 79.0}}
