nt process (Z) and includes branching fractions, making it more specific than the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_xsec_wplus", "why": "This is a total cross section for a different process (W+) and includes branching fractions, making it more specific than the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-inclusive-xsec", "why": "This is a total cross section for a different process (t-tbar-W), not Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_y_h", "why": "This is a differential cross section, not a total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_effective", "why": "This is about effective couplings and total width, not total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma_inel", "why": "This is the total inelastic cross section, not specifically for Higgs boson production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-minus-xsec", "why": "This is the inclusive cross section for a different process, not Higgs boson production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-plus-xsec", "why": "This is the inclusive cross section for a different process, not Higgs boson production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_ratio_wz", "why": "This is a ratio of cross sections for a different process, not Higgs boson production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:higgs_signal_strength_per_production", "why": "This is a signal strength modifier, not a total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_ratio_wpm", "why": "This is a ratio of cross sections for a different process, not Higgs boson production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-fiducial-xsec", "why": "This is a fiducial cross section for a different process, not Higgs boson production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:rc-ratio-inclusive", "why": "This is a ratio of cross sections for a different process, not Higgs boson production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-inclusive-hgg", "why": "This is a signal strength for a specific decay channel, not a total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:higgs_