me as modelling uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttZ-modelling", "why": "Specifically mentions ttZ background, which is not the same as diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:diboson_cross_section_theory", "why": "Mentions cross-section theoretical uncertainty, which is not the same as modelling uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:single_top_modelling", "why": "This is about single-top-quark background, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:semileptonic_ttbar_bkg_modelling", "why": "This is about semileptonic ttbar background, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:z-jets-modelling", "why": "This is about Z+jets background, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:tzq-modelling", "why": "This is about tZq modelling, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:nonprompt-lepton-bkg-modelling", "why": "This is about non-prompt-lepton background, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:background-variance-kfold", "why": "This is a general term for uncertainty in background modeling, but not specific to diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:mc-statistics", "why": "This is a statistical uncertainty in background predictions, not specific to diboson modeling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbar_modelling", "why": "This is specific to ttbar background modeling, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:data-driven-ttbar", "why": "This is specific to data-driven ttbar background estimation, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:spurious-signal", "why": "This is specific to multijet background modeling, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:misid_ltau_lprime", "why": "This is specific to misidentified background uncertainty, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:background-total-uncertainty", "why": "This is a total background uncertainty, not specific to diboson modeling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:vvv-normalization", "why": "This is specific to triboson background normalization, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:vertex-reconstruction-