ons-experimental", "why": "This is about lepton energy scale, resolution, reco, and ID efficiency, not specifically lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-xsec", "why": "This is about ttbar production cross section uncertainty, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:diboson-xsec", "why": "This is about diboson production cross section uncertainty, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:signal-cross-section-theory", "why": "This is about signal cross-section uncertainty, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton_tauh_id_efficiency", "why": "This is about muon, electron, and tau_h identification efficiency, not specifically lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttv_tth_uncertainty", "why": "This is about $t\bar{t}V$/$t\bar{t}H$ cross-section uncertainty, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton_trigger_efficiency", "why": "This is about lepton trigger efficiency, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:fake_lepton_dilepton_sf_norm", "why": "This is about fake-lepton scale-factor normalisation, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:signal-pileup", "why": "This is about pileup uncertainty on signal yield, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:fake-leptons", "why": "This is about fake/non-prompt lepton background, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:diboson_cross_section_theory", "why": "This is about diboson cross-section theoretical uncertainty, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:rw-pileup", "why": "This is about pileup uncertainty on R_W, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:e-to-tauh-energy-scale", "why": "This is about tau misidentification, not lepton charge misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:prompt-misid-rates", "why": "This is 