rix method."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:mc-cr-constrained-freefloat", "why": "This method combines simulation with control region normalisation, which is not the data-driven matrix method."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:signal_analogous_parameterisation", "why": "This method models background analogously to signal SMEFT parameterisation, which is not a data-driven matrix method."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:continuum_data_fit", "why": "This method models continuum background directly from data, which is a different technique from the data-driven matrix method."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:double-2d-sideband", "why": "This method uses a double two-dimensional sideband, which is a different data-driven technique but not the matrix method."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:cr-mistag-rate-estimation", "why": "This method uses control region-based mistag rates, which is a different technique from the data-driven matrix method."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:double_crystal_ball_fit", "why": "This method involves fitting a distribution but does not specifically use a data-driven matrix method."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-normalization", "why": "This method involves a profile-likelihood fit but does not specifically use a data-driven matrix method."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:dy_cr_transfer_factor", "why": "This method uses a transfer factor from a control region, which is a data-driven approach but not specifically the matrix method."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:data-embedding", "why": "This method involves embedding techniques, which is a different approach from the data-driven matrix method."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:nnlo_kfactor_qqzz", "why": "This method involves reweighting samples, which is not a data-driven matrix method."}, {"id": "hepkg:method:core-pdf-method-ggh", "why": "This method involves parametric background modeling, which is not a data-driven matrix method."}]}], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "value=set_1_refined", "abstention_challenged": false, "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "err