h is not related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:top-singlelepton", "why": "This is a top background in a single-lepton channel, which is not related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:gjets_tth_had", "why": "This is a gamma+jets background in a hadronic channel, which is not related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:material-conversion", "why": "This is a material-conversion electron background, which is not related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:singletop", "why": "This is a single-top background, which is not related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:bbww_dy", "why": "This is a Drell-Yan background, which is not specifically related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:diboson-rjr", "why": "This is a SM diboson background in a specific selection, but it is not specifically related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:multijet_tchannel", "why": "This is a multijet background in a t-channel single top analysis, which is not specifically related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:ww", "why": "This is a non-resonant WW diboson background, which is not specifically related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:resonant_leakage", "why": "This is a resonant background leakage, which is not specifically related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:diboson", "why": "This is a general diboson background, which is not specifically related to charge misidentification in the SS dilepton channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:background:xg_conversion", "why": "This is a photon conversion background, which is 