h for the WH production mode with the Higgs decaying to bb, which is not related to the invisible decay."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-h-fiducial", "why": "This is a cross section measurement, not a signal strength measurement as asked."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_zh_bb", "why": "This is a signal strength measurement but for a different decay mode (H→bb)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:vh_stxs_xsec_br", "why": "This is a signal strength measurement but for different processes (STXS regions)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:br_diff_mutau_etau", "why": "This is a branching ratio difference, not a signal strength measurement as asked."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-wh-3l-channel", "why": "This is a signal strength measurement but for a different production mode (WH)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-h-inclusive", "why": "This is a signal strength measurement but for an inclusive process, not specifically for invisible decays."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-h-fiducial", "why": "This is a signal strength measurement but for a fiducial region, not specifically for invisible decays."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_ggf2jets", "why": "This is a signal strength measurement but for a specific production mode (ggF+2 jets), not specifically for invisible decays."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-zh-4l-channel", "why": "This is a signal strength measurement but for a different decay mode (ZH in 4ℓ channel)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-z-fiducial-validation", "why": "This is a signal strength validation for Z→bb, not for H→invisible."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fiducial-cross-section-mumu-plus-p", "why": "This is a cross section measurement, not a signal strength measurement as asked."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:upper_limit_sigmaBR_XHH", "why": "This is an upper limit on a cross section times branching fraction, not a signal strength measurement as asked."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-wh-ss2l-channel", "why": "This is a signal strength measurement but for a different production mode